WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:05.140
Three little pigs decided to
build a house for themselves.

2
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.680
The first pig uses grass to cover the house, the
second one uses wood, and the third uses bricks.

3
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:17.260
One day, a wolf came, he blew the
first house, and the second house.

4
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:24.500
Two little pigs immediately ran into the red house, the wolf
wanted to blow the red house, but the red house was very firm.

5
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.880
Three pigs are safe, they understand,
work hard will bring security
